  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ordal">Ord</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif hit anfeald tyhle sy, dúfe seo hand ǽfter þam stane oð þa wríste, and gif hit þryfeald sy, oð þæne élbogan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if the accusation is 'single', the hand shall be plunged in up to the wrist in order to reach the stone; if it is 'threefold', up to the elbow.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 gif hit anfeald tyhle sy, dúfe seo hand ǽfter þam stane oð þa wríste, 7 gif hit þryfeald sy, oð þæne élbogan.</ab>
      </div>
